// Support eligibility from the game files; generated by scripts/build-support-eligibility.mjs.
// Sources (read only): <gamedata>/UE_game/Content/Script/Data/ConfigLogic/config_skill_stone.bin (+ _idx) — each support stone's include / exclude
// tag groups; <gamedata>/UE_game/Content/Script/Data/language/config_multi_language_en.bin — the tooltip text at skill_des|des_config|<stone id × 10>.
// A skill is eligible when it carries every tag of at least one include group and no exclude group is fully on it.
// TLIDB's SS14 cards publish the same Activation Medium text (checked 2026-10-12), except Tangle, where TLIDB also lists
// Whirlwind Blade; the installed game files (2026-10-10) exclude only Terra, Scorching Pulse and Lightning Storm by name.
// skillGameTagsSs13: each catalog skill's own tag ids from its stone record, linked by icon and accepted only when the
// visible tags equal the catalog's TLIDB tags. Skills or supports missing here fall back to src/support-compatibility.js's
// catalog rules.
